# Patch 0921 (wish of DevJunior, 13.11.2026: the PC mod "RE9 Melee - Hatchet - Finishers for Leon", "turn this into the
# remake, its controls too"). Not a bug of the prototype: a port feature of the mods.
# em10.cpp Dm_NeckBreak (R1 0x15, the neck break's enemy routine: always fatal, its motion, the body down into
# Die_Cramp) also plays Leon's finishers (runtime/finisher.cpp, a mod pack's melee/finish.dat): with one armed by the
# prompt on a stunned Ganado (runtime/melee.cpp), re4_finish_catch puts Leon at the pair's distance with the
# finisher's own routine instead of the neck break's catch; re4_melee_motion (patch 0904) gives the motions. Declared
# in re4_whole_prelude.h.
